  "description": {
    "text": "Basic Energy cards in the Diamond & Pearl design, with a ©2007 line and no set symbol or collection number, now in eight types with Darkness and Metal. The painting is the one the Japanese Entry Pack introduced and English Diamond & Pearl printed with numbers; these unnumbered copies came in theme decks of the Diamond & Pearl years. The set also holds a holo copy of each type."
